4	  "vulnerability_summary": "A malicious USB device lacking expected endpoints causes NULL-deref or out-of-bounds read in cx231xx_init_v4l2 and cx231xx_usb_probe by accessing endpoint array without validating bNumEndpoints against the isoc_pipe index.",
5	  "vulnerability_pattern": "USB driver accesses interface altsetting endpoint array using an assumed pipe index without first verifying bNumEndpoints exceeds that index, violating endpoint array bounds.",
